---
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Case Studies"
	description="Real outcomes from conversion optimisation projects across different industries."
>
	<p>Real outcomes from conversion optimisation projects across different industries.</p>

	<h2>Superannuation - Merger of QSuper and SunSuper</h2>

	<h3>Challenge</h3>

	<p>
		The merger of Sun Super and QSuper required deep acquisition knowledge and deep technical expertise to match the stakeholder's level of competence so the experiment velocity could reach the required conversion rate.
	</p>

	<h3>Solution</h3>

	<ul>
		<li>Optimised user journey touch points</li>
		<li>Multi-funnel option to maximise volume of experiments</li>
		<li>Shortened forms to maximise conversion rate</li>
		<li>Reporting and tracking catalogue oversight</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>Results</h3>

	<ul>
		<li>2x average industry conversion rate for Superannuation/Pension Scheme markets</li>
		<li>Queensland primary demographic to National Company with established brand</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>B2C Ecommerce - 90 Day Project</h2>

	<h3>2x Monthly Recurring Revenue</h3>

	<h3>Challenge</h3>

	<p>
		DTC dog food brand needed to scale operations and optimise customer touchpoints while enabling the CEO to step back from day-to-day operations.
	</p>

	<h3>Solution</h3>

	<ul>
		<li>Optimised marketing costs</li>
		<li>Redesigned conversion paths</li>
		<li>Enhanced email automation</li>
		<li>Improved partner channels</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>Results</h3>

	<ul>
		<li>100% MRR increase</li>
		<li>Streamlined user journeys</li>
		<li>Enhanced partner conversions</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Gaming Industry - Product Category Optimisation</h2>

	<h3>36% Revenue Increase Through User Flow Optimisation</h3>

	<h3>Challenge</h3>

	<p>
		Underperforming product category needed optimisation to prove viability against dominant category.
	</p>

	<h3>Solution</h3>

	<p>
		Simplified user flows based on core user intent and betting behaviour patterns.
	</p>

	<h3>Results</h3>

	<ul>
		<li>36% category revenue increase</li>
		<li>29% Day 1 improvement</li>
		<li>One of primary characteristics of sale of business</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Enterprise / ASX 200 - Digital Transformation</h2>

	<h3>75,000 Worker Productivity Enhancement</h3>

	<h3>Challenge</h3>

	<p>
		Scattered information systems causing productivity bottlenecks across global operations.
	</p>

	<h3>Solution</h3>

	<p>
		Rapid transformation to unified global digital network with optimised user experiences.
	</p>

	<h3>Impact</h3>

	<ul>
		<li>75,000 workers enabled</li>
		<li>Improved productivity</li>
		<li>Reduced operational costs</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Dating App MVP in 14 Days</h2>

	<p>Rapid design-to-market for technically advanced dating application.</p>

	<ul>
		<li>14-day delivery</li>
		<li>Market-ready design</li>
		<li>Brand-aligned</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Healthcare DTC - Teeth Straightening Brand Launch</h2>

	<p>Conversion strategy and funnel optimisation for successful market entry.</p>

	<ul>
		<li>Day 1 profitability</li>
		<li>Optimised purchase flow</li>
	</ul>
</Layout>
